<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's J.Martins ponders Vidago bid.</title>
<headline>Portugal's J.Martins ponders Vidago bid.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese retailer Jeronimo Martins said it was studying the possibility of making a public offer (OPA) to buy all the shares of mineral water group Vidago and that no decision had been taken as to whether to bid.</p>
</text>
